== diags.diag/log-level-as-verb
BYN5007 2:5 `Log.debug` names a level, not the act; write `log(…, as: .debug)`
  help call `log` and pass the level `as: .debug`
  fix 2:5-2:28 log("cache miss", as: .debug)
BYN5007 3:5 `Log.error` names a level, not the act; write `log(…, as: .error)`
  help call `log` and pass the level `as: .error`
